<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>You're in</mj-title>
    <!-- Preview text: shows next to the subject in the inbox. -->
    <mj-preview>Plus one question, if you have ten seconds.</mj-preview>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text font-size="16px" line-height="1.65" color="#1F2937" padding="0 0 18px 0" />
      <mj-section padding="0" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      a { color: #1B4B9B; }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <!-- Narrow and left-aligned on purpose: it should read like a person wrote
       it, not like a campaign. That is what keeps it out of Promotions. -->
  <mj-body background-color="#ffffff" width="560px">
    <mj-section padding="40px 24px 0 24px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Hey,</mj-text>

        <mj-text>
          Thanks for joining the Veyns early cohort — you're on the list.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text>
          Quick context on what you signed up for. You drop in a lab report,
          any PDF from Quest, Labcorp, or your doctor. Veyns parses every
          biomarker automatically. No manual entry. Then your Whoop, Oura, and
          Apple Health data land on the same axis.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text>
          One timeline, instead of a dozen apps and a folder of PDFs you never
          open twice.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text>
          We're building the lab-report parser first, because it's the hardest
          part and nothing works without it. You'll get an email when it's
          ready to test — before it's public.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text padding="10px 0 18px 0">
          One thing, if you have ten seconds:
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text font-size="17px" color="#1B4B9B" padding="0 0 18px 0">
          <strong>Which biomarker do you actually care about?</strong>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text>
          Hit reply and name it. ApoB, HbA1c, ferritin, testosterone — whatever
          made you sign up. The early cohort shapes what gets built first, and
          replying is the fastest way for you to do that.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text>
          I read every one.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text padding="14px 0 0 0">
          — Krishna<br />
          <span style="color:#6B7280;">Founder, Veyns</span>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding="34px 24px 40px 24px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-color="#E5E7EB" padding="0 0 18px 0" />
        <mj-text font-size="12px" color="#9CA3AF" line-height="1.6" padding="0">
          You're getting this because you joined the Veyns waitlist.<br />
          <a href="{unsubscribe_link}" style="color:#9CA3AF;">Unsubscribe</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
